7:17Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Answers: LAX Los Angeles International Airport", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:17:27Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Nikhil: 10, Sayu: 10, Saumay: 10, Sal: 40, Khandoba: 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:17:56Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Airport security did not know about the shooting in advance. Back then (before 9/11), you could just walk to the gate area without any security checks or ID checks", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:18:02Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "the crew took full advantage of that", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:18:39Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "next", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]